       "text": "I haven't entered this order yet. I need you to confirm the dose first.\n\n**The concern:** Sertraline 1000 mg once daily is 5 times the maximum recommended adult dose of 200 mg/day. Usual dosing is:\n- **Starting dose:** 25\u201350 mg once daily\n- **Usual range:** 50\u2013200 mg once daily\n- **Maximum:** 200 mg/day\n\nAt 1000 mg there's a real risk of serotonin syndrome, QTc prolongation and seizures. This looks like it could be an extra zero, and the intended dose might be **100 mg**.\n\n**Please confirm one of these:**\n1. **Sertraline 100 mg PO once daily** (or another dose within 25\u2013200 mg). I'll enter it right away.\n2. **1000 mg is intended.** If so, please share the clinical reason. An order this far above the maximum would usually also need pharmacy review before it's given."
      }
